    {
      "img": "icons/magic/nature/root-vine-entangle-foot-green.webp",
      "name": "Grasping Snare",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>You rig vines and ropes to hold a creature in place. The first creature to enter the square must attempt a @Check[reflex|showDC:all|dc:26] save with the following effects.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes a –5-foot status penalty to its Speed for 1 minute or until it [[/act escape show-dc=all dc=26]]{Escapes}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round, then takes a –5-foot status penalty to its Speed for 1 minute. Both effects end early if it Escapes (DC 26).</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is immobilized for 1 minute or until it Escapes (DC 26).</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.N5L79du6FpRgc9Cd]{Effect: Grasping Snare}</p>"
        },
